{arr: Intro: desert riff ("kamila") + teaser of the melody; the riff stays (gives Em) + percussion hits.}
{arr: V1: melody only (solo singer) + chord pad. *BAM!*}
{arr: V2: + drone (bordun).}
{arr: V3: + harmony in thirds (terca).}
{arr: Instrumental, 2 verses long, 2x: percussion accelerating + melody teaser. *BAM!*}
{arr: V4 + V5: tutti (3 voices + percussion + chords + melody teaser).}
{arr: *Drama* pause, no BAM.}
{arr: V6: a cappella, 3 voices, accelerating. BAM!}
