{evidence: Whole-song key estimate E minor (0.81). basic-pitch: E 1.00, B 0.99, G 0.69, D 0.23, F# 0.20, A 0.17; D# almost absent, so the H chord is short or played as B5/B7.}
{evidence: Am appeared in only one window (1:46); the board's 'a' at 'Moj' is kept but not confirmed by audio.}
{uncertain: 'Preli prelo' = the spinning-bee (prelo) went on; nuance of 'milo do miloga' (darling beside darling) is idiomatic.}
{uncertain: 'Oj planiko, slatka vareniko': planika (strawberry tree, or a mountain lass) and varenika (warm boiled milk, or mulled rakija) are both possible; translated literally.}
{uncertain: The board repeats Em over 'se' in 'Nemoj mi se'; the repeated chord is left out on the sheet.}
{uncertain: Chords on verses 3-6 copied from the marked verse 2 pattern (same melody), not marked on the board.}

{section: 1}
[Em]Preli [Am]prelo [B]milo do mi[Em]loga || The spinning-bee went on, darling beside darling, || ×2
[Am]moj u vojsci, [B]ja nemam do [Em]koga. || my love is in the army, I have no one beside me. || ×2

{section: 2}
[Em]Nemoj mi se se[B]kirati, [Em]diko, || Don't you fret, my darling,
[Em]što do [D]mene [B]ne voli te [Em]niko. || that no one but me loves you.

{section: 3}
[~Em]Kaži pravo, ti [~B]zelena [~Em]travo, || Tell me truly, you green grass,
[~Em]šta je [~D]lepše, [~B]plavo il' ga[~Em]ravo. || which is lovelier, fair-haired or dark-haired.

{section: 4}
[~Em]Igra kolo pred [~B]bijelim [~Em]dvorom, || The kolo is danced before the white manor,
[~Em]pred ju[~D]načkim [~B]i pred devo[~Em]jačkim. || before the young man's and before the maiden's.

{section: 5}
[~Em]Oj planiko, slat[~B]ka vare[~Em]niko, || Oh planika, sweet warm varenika,
[~Em]doma[~D]ćine, [~B]medena ra[~Em]kijo! || oh host, oh honey rakija!

{section: 6}
[Em]Preli prelo… || The spinning-bee went on…
